 "body": "はじめまして！あなたの絵がとても好きなので、私のOCの絵をあなたに依頼したいです。\nこれが私のOCの設定です：https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/a9yhrtqzd3567mbdkmy39/h?rlkey=41q0q13siskgludxnisj46fhf&dl=0\nあまり詳細な設定画がなくて申し訳ありません！(T_T)\n\n\n以下は依頼のための私のアイデアです：\nバーのような場所にいる彼をよく妄想するのですが、お酒が強くてバーの人気者になりそうな気がします。颯爽と『みなさん、お久しぶりです』とか言って。\n絵を描くときの雰囲気のコントロールがとても上手だと感じるので、バーのシーンの彼を描いてほしいです。\n本当にありがとうございました！❥❥❥❥\n\nGreetings! I would like to commission you to paint my OC because I like your paintings very much.\nI apologize for not having many and very detailed setting drawingsTT\nHere are my ideas for the commission:\nI often fantasize about him in a bar type of place, and I feel like he'd be a popular character in a bar crowd because he's a good drinker     ,Dashing saying something like, 'It's been a long time, everyone.'\nI feel that you have a very good control of the atmosphere of the scene, so I'd like you to draw him in a bar scene.\nThank you vert very much!!!❥❥❥❥\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/a9yhrtqzd3567mbdkmy39/h?rlkey=41q0q13siskgludxnisj46fhf&dl=0", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hotoke_party/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 190069, "client_id": 3160072, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/de236653/uploads/origins/33b28cba-e2da-4af5-b151-526e76615283?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=75ef7d8e4d14ed38273951b641f56927", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/de236653/uploads/origins/33b28cba-e2da-4af5-b151-526e76615283?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=75ef7d8e4d14ed38273951b641f56927, https://si.imgix.net/de236653/uploads/origins/33b28cba-e2da-4af5-b151-526e76615283?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=503b0aca50fed8d52fb6783ef9ce32af 2x, https://si.imgix.net/de236653/uploads/origins/33b28cba-e2da-4af5-b151-526e7